# ui/dist/index.mjs is the shipped page bundle and is committed on purpose:
# `kirocrew app install` copies the app directory as-is and never runs
# `vite build`, and the gateway serves <app>/ui/<ui.entry> verbatim.
# tests/test_ui_bundle.py fails if it drifts from a fresh build of ui/src.
